{
  "id": "E325",
  "title": "Pulling Out White Hair",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-05-19",
  "synopsis": "Why you should not pull out your white hair.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1047/a572addd71c22d49bf092b275408b89640c82537.mp3?1557400586",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "千万别拔白头发\n\n保罗：快帮我看看，我是不是有灰头发了？\n小乐：“灰头发”？你是说白头发吧。真的有一根。\n保罗：原来中国人都说“白头发”。你快帮我拔了吧。\n小乐：不行，不能拔白头发，会越来越多的。\n保罗：为什么？\n小乐：因为这根头发旁边的头发都被吓白了呀。",
    "traditional": "千萬別拔白頭髮\n\n保羅：快幫我看看，我是不是有灰頭髮了？\n小樂：“灰頭髮”？你是說白頭髮吧。真的有一根。\n保羅：原來中國人都說“白頭髮”。你快幫我拔了吧。\n小樂：不行，不能拔白頭髮，會越來越多的。\n保羅：為什麼？\n小樂：因為這根頭髮旁邊的頭髮都被嚇白了呀。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Don’t pull out your white hair under any circumstances"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：快帮我看看，我是不是有灰头发了？",
      "traditional": "保羅：快幫我看看，我是不是有灰頭髮了？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó kuài bāng wǒ kàn kan wǒ shì bú shì yǒu huī tóu fa le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Quickly help me have a look, do I have gray hair?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：“灰头发”？你是说白头发吧。真的有一根。",
      "traditional": "小樂：“灰頭髮”？你是說白頭髮吧。真的有一根。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè huī tóu fa nǐ shì shuō bái tóu fa ba zhēn de yǒu yì gēn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: “Gray hair”? You mean white hair. You really have one."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：原来中国人都说“白头发”。你快帮我拔了吧。",
      "traditional": "保羅：原來中國人都說“白頭髮”。你快幫我拔了吧。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó yuán lái zhōng guó rén dōu shuō bái tóu fa nǐ kuài bāng wǒ bá le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: So \"white hair\" is what all Chinese people say. Quickly help me pull it out."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：不行，不能拔白头发，会越来越多的。",
      "traditional": "小樂：不行，不能拔白頭髮，會越來越多的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bù xíng bù néng bá bái tóu fa huì yuè lái yuè duō de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: No, you shouldn’t pull out your white hair, you might get more and more of them."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：为什么？",
      "traditional": "保羅：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：因为这根头发旁边的头发都被吓白了呀。",
      "traditional": "小樂：因為這根頭髮旁邊的頭髮都被嚇白了呀。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yīn wèi zhè gēn tóu fa páng biān de tóu fa dōu bèi xià bái le ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Because the hair around that one will all get frightened and pale."
    }
  ],
